Provenance
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The decoder is an original implementation written from ETSI TS 102 114
V1.6.1 (2019-08), "DTS Coherent Acoustics; Core and Extensions with
Additional Profiles", published free of charge by ETSI. It is not a
translation of, and does not derive from, any other DTS decoder's source.
The normative tables (Annex D) were transcribed from the ETSI PDF by
tools/dts_gen_tables.py and cross-checked against the V1.2.1 (2002-12)
edition. The two code books no ETSI edition prints (D.10.1 and D.10.2) are
not included and were not taken from anywhere else.

The decoder is verified against ffmpeg's decoder, used only as a black box
(a command-line tool whose PCM is compared); none of its code is included
or was consulted. The test streams are made at test time by ffmpeg's
encoder, run the same way.

